{"id": "r07_01", "text": "Sort the objects by colour: red into the right bin, yellow into the left bin, blue into the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_02", "text": "Blue items into the left bin; red items into the center bin; yellow items into the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_03", "text": "Could you put the yellow pieces in the right-hand bin, the blue ones in the left-hand bin and the red ones in the one in the middle? Thanks!", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_04", "text": "Everything blue belongs in the centre bin. Red things go on the left, and yellow things on the right.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_05", "text": "The leftmost bin takes the yellow objects, the rightmost bin takes the blue objects, and the red objects go in the middle one.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_06", "text": "Red and yellow objects both go into the left bin; blue objects go into the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_07", "text": "Put every single object into the middle bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_08", "text": "Reds on the right please, yellows and blues on the left.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_09", "text": "Kindly place the blue objects into the right bin, the red objects into the left bin, and the yellow ones into the central bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_10", "text": "Move the red objects to the right bin, the yellow objects to the center bin, and the blue objects to the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_11", "text": "Your task is to sort the objects into the bins by colour. Use the center bin for red, the left bin for yellow, and the right bin for blue.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_12", "text": "Put the yellow things in the middle bin and all other objects in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_13", "text": "Blue goes left. Red goes right. Yellow goes in the middle.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_14", "text": "put red in the left bin yellow in the rigth bin and blue in the centre bin", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_15", "text": "Sort the red objects into the center bin and the blue and yellow objects into the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_16", "text": "The left bin is for red, the right bin is for yellow, and the middle bin is for blue.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_17", "text": "I'd like the blue objects to go in the right bin. The red ones should go in the middle bin, and the yellow ones in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_18", "text": "Drop all yellow objects in the left bin and all red and blue objects in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_19", "text": "Place the yellow objects in the right bin, the red ones in the left bin, and the blue ones in the right bin as well.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_20", "text": "Sort everything into the right bin except the blue objects, which go into the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_21", "text": "Red objects: left bin. Yellow objects: center bin. Blue objects: right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_22", "text": "Each colour gets its own bin: red in the right one, blue in the middle one, yellow in the left one.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_23", "text": "Put the blue objects in the middle bin, then the red objects in the right bin, and finally the yellow objects in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_24", "text": "Please sort the objects: the yellow ones into the middle bin, the red ones into the left bin, the blue ones into the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_25", "text": "Red, blue and yellow objects go into the right, left and center bins, in that order.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_26", "text": "Put all the objects in the left bin, but the yellow ones go in the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_27", "text": "Blue and red go together in the middle bin; yellow goes to the right.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_28", "text": "Toss the red objects into the left bin, the blue objects into the center bin and the yellow objects into the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_29", "text": "Arrange it so the yellow objects end up in the left bin, the red ones in the right bin, and the blue ones in the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_30", "text": "All of the blue things shuold end up in the left bin, and the yelow and red things in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "color", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_31", "text": "Put all the cubes in the left bin, the cylinders in the center bin and the triangles in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_32", "text": "Red cubes go in the left bin, and every other object goes in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_33", "text": "Put the blue cylinders in the middle bin; all remaining objects go in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_34", "text": "Sort by colour, with red on the left, yellow in the center and blue on the right, except for the triangles: all triangles go in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_35", "text": "Every cylinder goes in the right bin. The other objects are sorted by colour: red and yellow ones to the left bin, blue ones to the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_36", "text": "Place the yellow triangles in the left bin, the blue cubes in the center bin, and the red cylinders in the right bin. Everything else goes in the center bin too.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_37", "text": "Triangular prisms into the left bin, cubes into the right bin, cylinders into the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_38", "text": "Blue cubes and yellow cubes in the right bin, red cubes in the left bin; put all the round ones (the cylinders) and the triangles in the middle bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_39", "text": "The left bin is for cubes, the middle bin for triangles, and the right bin for cylinders.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_40", "text": "Put red objects in the center bin, but any red triangle goes to the left bin instead. Yellow and blue objects go in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_41", "text": "Sort the cylinders by colour: red ones left, yellow ones center, blue ones right. All cubes and triangles go in the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_42", "text": "Put every yellow object and every cube in the left bin; everything else goes in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_43", "text": "Put the red objects in the left bin and the blue ones in the right bin. Leave the yellow objects on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_44", "text": "Only sort the blue objects, into the middle bin; leave everything else where it is.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_45", "text": "Move the yellow objects to the right bin and the red ones to the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_46", "text": "Put all cubes in the center bin. The other shapes stay on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_47", "text": "Sort everything into the left bin except yellow, which should stay on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_48", "text": "Red objects go to the right bin. Don't touch the blue cylinders; all other blue objects and all yellow objects go into the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_49", "text": "Put the blue triangles in the left bin and the red cubes in the right bin. Nothing else needs to be moved.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_50", "text": "Please leave the red objects alone. Put yellow in the center bin and blue in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r07_51", "text": "All red pieces, whatever their shape (cubes, cylinders, triangles, it doesn't matter), go in the middle bin. Yellow pieces of any shape go in the left bin, and blue pieces of any shape go in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "adv_shape_as_detail", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r07_52", "text": "Three rules, and if they clash, the later rule wins. First: everything goes to the center bin. Second: yellow goes to the right bin. Third: blue cylinders go to the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "adv_later_rule_wins", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r07_53", "text": "Chuck anything crimson into the far-right bin, stash the navy bits in the middle one, and bung the lemon-coloured stuff on the far left.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "adv_rare_verbs_synonyms", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r07_54", "text": "Before you start, make sure the left bin and the right bin are empty and pushed against the wall. Then put all objects in the center bin, apart from the blue ones, which belong in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "adv_bins_mentioned_not_assigned", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r07_55", "text": "Red goes further left than blue, and blue goes further left than yellow. Each colour has its own bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "adv_comparative", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r07_56", "text": "The objects going into the right bin are the blue ones; the ones going into the left bin are the red ones; whatever is yellow is headed for the middle bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "adv_pseudo_cleft", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r07_57", "text": "Sort by colour temperature: the warm colours go in the right bin and the cool colour goes in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "adv_warm_cool", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r07_58", "text": "Take the usual arrangement (red in the left bin, yellow in the center bin, blue in the right bin) and mirror it, so that left and right trade places.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "adv_mirror", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r07_59", "text": "Blue goes in neither the right bin nor the middle bin. Red goes in neither the left bin nor the right bin. Yellow goes in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "adv_neither_nor_bins", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r07_60", "text": "Use the left bin, not the center bin, for the yellow objects, and the center bin instead of the right bin for the red objects. Blue objects go in the right bin, not the left one.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "adv_instead_of", "adversarial": true}
